# With X=1 a land cannot be targeted, while an artifact can (CR 115.1).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Island
Ornithopter
Heliod's Intervention
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Heliod's Intervention.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Modes(1)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = false
